# Exact-row pins (DCRIT r120): every captured drafter row M of a deployment's capture
# list is searched at exactly M (ltsearch, cuBLASLt 13.8.1, 1 VR200 GPU, cold weights,
# median of 7 x 10 replays). A row is pinned only when the search's best beats the
# cuBLASLt heuristic by > 1% and a per-call A/B against F.linear (interleaved, 14
# rounds each) does not find it slower; every other searched row is a DEFAULT_ROWS row
# (F.linear itself). These win over PINS and BIN_PINS. Searched: the K3.1 k3
# production capture list (sizes 4..384 step 4, max_num_seqs 96: drafter rows 3b /
# 4b) and the k5 / k7 aligned SP lists (every lcm(q, 4) rows to 768 / 968).
